Description: Forum: the Armatos software market
 Install, remove and update software from the APT archives, and firmware
 through fwupd, in marble and porphyry. The engine is KDE Discover, rebuilt
 for Armatos without its web view or snap backend; Forum gives it its own
 face: TABERNAE (the stalls), QVAERE, POSSESSA, TRIBVTVM (updates) and
 FONTES (sources). Flatpak apps appear only once Flatpak support is added,
 and are always sealed PEREGRINA, foreign goods.
